				- Wayfarers Discover Taelosia -<br>
<br>
The Wayfarers Brotherhood took the great ship, the Queen of Thorns, across the Abysmal Sea and found a continent surrounded by turbulent storms. Using the strange new stones, the ship now rests protected off the shores.<br>
<br>
Magus Wenla said he had been in touch with a scout who was sent back to Antonica to prepare others to sail to the new continent.<br>
<br>
'The scout said it was a terrible journey, but they followed the Grozmok Stone the whole way - it did as Calliav thought. It was a compass that led them into a safe harbor on the west side of the continent," Wenla said.<br>
<br>
There is a boat that will travel between Nedaria's Landing and the Abysmal Sea, Wenla said. He added that the scout had mentioned terrible creatures in that new part of the world. Only the most sturdy and skilled should dare venture to the continent.<br>
<br>
- Fier'Dal Connect -<br>
<br>
For several weeks, the fearless Fier'Dal have replaced the power of the gods with their own vast magic resources. <br>
<br>
With prayer and donations to the cause, Kelethin and its people now have an excess of favor to draw power from now that the gods lend no hand.<br>
<br>
This favor, as it is called, is a magical pool that all Fier'Dal can draw from for power and benefits, should they donate to it.<br>
<br>
A Tribute master has been designated in our fair tree city with the authority to take donations and grant benefits to our kin in return.			</td></tr>
